From 9f5bd4c0a8bfd06f5ddfeabe31b093052e6422e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dwaipayan <dwaipayan@MacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 23:36:21 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] econet: add EN7528 GPON (xPON) ONT support (econet-xpon
 driver, OMCI daemon)

Port of openwrt/openwrt PR #24577 (AKoo7, econet-xpon-gpon) onto main:
- kmod-econet-xpon: GPON xPON MAC + EN7571 optical front-end driver,
  ponwan0 WAN netdev, ONU identity via UCI (config econet-xpon)
- econet-omcid: native OMCI daemon; econet-xpon-config: UCI/init loader
- luci-app-econet-xpon: GPON status + identity web UI
- econet-eth: PON datapath seam patch (100-xpon-bench-spike)
- jio,jcow407 board (en7528_jio_jcow407.dts) + en75_chboot case
- jiofiber jcow414/jcow407 images: add econet-xpon-config + econet-omcid
- 02_network: jio,jcow407 LAN case

tools/elfutils host fix from the PR omitted (only needed for glibc >= 2.41
hosts; builds here run in an ubuntu 22.04 container).
