+/*****************************************************************************
+//function :
+//		phy_trans_param_status_real
+//description : 
+//		this function is used to get transceiver parameter realtime
+		Note: before call this function, should check if(i2c_protect == 0)
+//input :	
+//		PPHY_TransParam_T structure, defined in phy_api.h
