+	/* â˜… mainline dual-CL config (merbanan LDDLA diff): FORCE the Pav/P1 loop to the calibrated
+	 * setpoints (0x258[1:0]=3) + enable KT Imod-adjust (0x230[0]=1) BEFORE closing the DCL, so the
