+/*****************************************************************************
+//function :
+//		phy_tx_fec_manual
+//description : 
+//		this function is used to set Tx FEC by manual
+//input :	
+//		tx_fec_en : PHY_ENABLE  means enable manual mode ; PHY_DISABLE  means disable manual mode
+//output :
